# ===========================================================================
# GameCore .gitignore
#
# The module itself has no standalone configure -- see the FATAL_ERROR guard
# at the top of CMakeLists.txt -- so there is no Build/ tree that belongs to
# it specifically. This file exists for local IDE/build clutter that can
# still land here if an editor is pointed directly at this directory, and
# mirrors Modules/GameWindow's own .gitignore for the same reason that one
# exists despite GameWindow also having no standalone configure.
#
# Nothing under External/lua-5.4.8/ needs excluding: unlike SDL, Lua's
# official distribution ships no examples/ or test/ tree alongside its
# library sources -- src/ is the interpreter and library, doc/ is the HTML
# manual, and both are committed in full.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/Build/
/build/
/cmake-build-*/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
compile_commands.json
